WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:02.680
Laghu Chaityavandan Vidhi

00:03.080 --> 00:07.000
Say 3 times Khamasaman Sutra

00:07.200 --> 00:08.640
Then give 3 Khamasaman

00:09.240 --> 00:12.800
Then, in the Yoga Mudra,

00:12.800 --> 00:14.520
recite the "Arihant Cheiyanam Sutra"

00:16.840 --> 00:18.560
and "Annatha Sutra"

00:20.880 --> 00:22.760
recite 1 Navkar Mantra in 1 Kausagga

00:23.120 --> 00:24.840
say "Namo Arihantaṇaṁ"

00:25.040 --> 00:26.200
After completing Kausagga,

00:26.400 --> 00:27.400
with join hands

00:27.400 --> 00:28.480
in the Yoga Mudra,

00:28.480 --> 00:30.320
recite Stuti or Thoy

00:33.920 --> 00:35.480
Then give 1 Khamasaman

00:40.160 --> 00:42.960
say "Avidhi Ashatana
Michchhami Dukkadam"
